.TH MODIFY_LDT 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
modify_ldt \- invokes linux modify_ldt with the raw operation and architecture-specific buffer
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sys/syscall_extra.h>
.B int modify_ldt(int operation, void* buffer, unsigned long byte_count);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Invokes Linux modify_ldt with the raw operation and architecture-specific buffer.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the syscall result, or \-1 with errno set.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR modify_ldt (2)
